 {:db/id "231c62cd-5950-547a-92f8-00b5add4ed60"
  :question/id #uuid "231c62cd-5950-547a-92f8-00b5add4ed60"
  :question/problem "Source question: Canvas Question 1 (question_59459019).\n\nLet $V$ be a subspace of $\\mathbb R^n$. Is the zero vector in $V$?"
  :question/answer-fields ["358b9fe9-c413-50e9-81f7-29b1293b42fc"]
  :question/worked-solution "A subspace is nonempty, so choose $\\mathbf v\\in V$. Closure under scalar multiplication gives $0\\mathbf v=\\mathbf0\\in V$. This includes the zero subspace $V=\\{\\mathbf0\\}$."
  :db/ensure :question/validate}
